---
// HowItWorksIntro.astro — extraído de HowItWorks.astro
---

<!-- ==============================================
     ENCABEZADO EDITORIAL CENTRADO
     ============================================== -->
<header class="section-intro" data-reveal="editorial">
  <div class="eyebrow-wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="eyebrow-text">UN PROCESO SIMPLE Y CONTROLADO</span>
  </div>

  <h2 id="how-it-works-title" class="section-title">
    De la información dispersa <br class="br-desktop" />
    a la documentación preparada
  </h2>

  <p class="section-description">
    DECA Light coordina la información del almacén y del transporte, la organiza y te ayuda a preparar la documentación de cada expedición para su revisión.
  </p>
</header>

<style>
  .section-intro {
      max-width: 52rem;
      margin-inline: auto;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .section-intro {
          margin-bottom: 4.5rem;
        }
  }
  .eyebrow-wrap {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.625rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
      cursor: default;
    }
  .eyebrow-line {
      width: 1.5rem;
      height: 2.5px;
      background-color: var(--palette-deca-800);
      border-radius: 9999px;
      transition: width 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
  .eyebrow-wrap:hover .eyebrow-line {
      width: 2.25rem;
    }
  .eyebrow-text {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--palette-deca-800);
    }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .eyebrow-text {
          font-size: 0.8125rem;
        }
  }
  .section-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      color: var(--palette-slate-900);
      margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
      word-break: break-word;
    }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .section-title {
          font-size: 2.5rem;
        }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .section-title {
          font-size: 3rem;
          line-height: 1.18;
        }
  }
  .br-desktop {
      display: none;
    }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .br-desktop {
          display: inline;
        }
  }
  .section-description {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: var(--palette-slate-600);
      max-width: 42rem;
      margin-inline: auto;
      margin-block: 0;
      word-break: break-word;
    }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .section-description {
          font-size: 1.125rem;
        }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .eyebrow-line,
        .step-badge,
        .format-pill,
        .icon-pdf,
        .icon-csv,
        .icon-manual,
        .doc-ghost,
        .card-cmr,
        .card-porte,
        .card-cmr-4,
        .card-porte-4,
        .albaran-box,
        .validation-card,
        .hub-coordination-card,
        .deca-output-card,
        .flow-dashed-path,
        .ping-circle,
        .pending-icon-circle,
        .pending-callout-box,
        .clock-spin-icon,
        .hub-emblem,
        .animate-shimmer::after,
        .benefit-item,
        .benefit-icon-box {
          animation: none !important;
          transition: none !important;
          transform: none !important;
        }
  }

  @keyframes ping {
      75%, 100% {
        transform: scale(2);
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }
</style>
